TI  - Growth and Break-Up of Methanogenic Granules Suggests Mechanisms for Biofilm and Community Development
AU  - Anna Christine Trego
AU  - Evan Galvin
AU  - Conor Sweeney
AU  - Sinéad Dunning
AU  - Cillian Murphy
