TI  - Recent advances in microbial engineering approaches for wastewater treatment: a review
AU  - Monika Sharma
AU  - Sangita Agarwal
AU  - Richa Agarwal Malik
AU  - Gaurav Kumar
AU  - Dan Bahadur Pal
AU  - Mamun Mandal
AU  - Abhijit Sarkar
AU  - Farkad Bantun
