TI  - PHYLOGENETIC ANALYSIS OF BACTERIAL CELLULOLYTIC ETHANOLOGENS FROM COPTOTERMES HEIMI (TERMITE)
AU  - Adil Shaheen
AU  - Ayesha Aihetasham
AU  - Asma Chaudhary
