TI  - Microbial transformations by sulfur bacteria can recover value from phosphogypsum: A global problem and a possible solution
AU  - Ayoub Bounaga
AU  - Anwar Alsanea
AU  - Karim Lyamlouli
AU  - Chen Zhou
AU  - Youssef Zeroual
