TI  - A novel injectable radiopaque hydrogel with potent properties for multicolor CT imaging in the context of brain and cartilage regenerative therapy
AU  - Moustoifa Said
AU  - Clément Tavakoli
AU  - Chloé Dumot
AU  - Karine Toupet
AU  - Yuxi C. Dong
